\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces  Numerical diagnostics aggregated over all 18 primary simulation scenarios. Converged fits are successful fits satisfying the explicit convergence criterion; successful nonconverged fits completed without failure but did not satisfy that criterion. Failed denotes fits with \texttt  {status = failed}. Latency-bound contacts count final successful fits with at least one of the generalized-gamma parameters $a$, $d$, or $p$ at the lower optimization bound of $10^{-5}$. The $\phi $-bound column counts contacts with the negative-binomial dispersion lower bound of $10^{-8}$; a dash indicates that the dispersion parameter is not applicable. Runtime is the mean with the maximum in parentheses, in seconds. }}{10}{table.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:supp-simulation-diagnostics}{{5}{10}{Numerical diagnostics aggregated over all 18 primary simulation scenarios. Converged fits are successful fits satisfying the explicit convergence criterion; successful nonconverged fits completed without failure but did not satisfy that criterion. Failed denotes fits with \texttt {status = failed}. Latency-bound contacts count final successful fits with at least one of the generalized-gamma parameters $a$, $d$, or $p$ at the lower optimization bound of $10^{-5}$. The $\phi $-bound column counts contacts with the negative-binomial dispersion lower bound of $10^{-8}$; a dash indicates that the dispersion parameter is not applicable. Runtime is the mean with the maximum in parentheses, in seconds}{table.5}{}}
